    "201 raw x-ms-version-id followed by raw-versionid GET",
    "412 List Blob Versions and raw-versionid GET with none, ambiguous and foreign negatives",
    "Fresh tenant, subscription and storage resource readback bindings without plaintext evidence",
    "Exact-version Locked, retention, legal-hold capability, CMK and canonical-content negatives",
    "Dedicated writer add/read and exact container, policy and encryption-scope management reads",
    "Canonical irreversible lock plan with target, stale-ETag and request-hash negatives",
